      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DREAM BIG (8) struggled to get involved last start after being shuffled back early at this track, but prior to that won by 3 lengths at this track (22.35) beating Archie's Gift in a Rank Limit - Grade 5 on September 1. Comes through a solid form race last start. Has ability and is a key runner. SPANISH FAWN (6) flew the lids with a strong early split and led throughout to score an impressive win by 4 lengths over 400m at Warragul (22.83). Ran the fastest time on the program in her latest win. Sure to measure up. MANDOLIN STORM (3) has a strong record this track and trip with seven wins and eight placings from 20 starts. Comes off a (25.62) win last time, scoring by 5.5 lengths in a Grade 5 over 450m at Ballarat. Can feature with the right run. DOONGALLA ADAM (4) cannot be underestimated.",
